<item>Heu 901 Ct. <hi rendition="#aq">a</hi> 10 Gr. <space dim="horizontal"/> <hi rendition="#u">375 &#x2033; 10 Gr.</hi></item><lb/>
<item><space dim="horizontal"/> 1208 Rthlr. 10 Gr.</item><lb/>
<item>Die &#x017F;a&#x0364;mmtlichen Ko&#x017F;ten waren 1589 Rthlr.</item><lb/>
